# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# nightfury-server
#
# Rule of thumb for this repo: every *.example.* file is COMMITTED
# (it documents the shape), every real one next to it is IGNORED.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Local deploy scripts ───────────────────────────────────────
# Your real paths, hosts, and any keys live in these. The .example
# twins are committed, so a fresh clone starts from those.
# Leading slash = root only, so front-node/install.sh stays tracked.
/deploy.sh
/start-server.sh
/diagnose.sh

# ── docs/config.js is deliberately NOT ignored ─────────────────
# GitHub Pages serves docs/. Ignore a file there and it never
# reaches GitHub, so the live offline page 404s on it and loses
# its probe target and contact form. It is public either way, so
# keep only public values in it — never a real secret.

# ── Secrets (none of these belong in any folder here) ──────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials.json

# ── OS + editor cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Runtime noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
node_modules/
.cache/
